    "text": "This is a greedy heuristic, not an optimal solver. It was written against the statement only and has not been run on the real data sets, so I can't give scores.\n\n**What it does**\n- **Feature priority.** Each feature gets a ranking key based on its users, the total days of work across its binaries, and its longest single task. Several key formulas are tried.\n- **Day-by-day simulation.** Each day, free engineers are handled in increasing index order. Each takes the next pending binary task of an already-started feature. If none is pending, the next feature in priority order is opened, but only if every one of its binary tasks could still finish before the time limit `L`.\n- **Durations.** A task's duration is computed exactly as `D + R + C`.\n  - `C` counts tasks on that binary that are still running, plus tasks started the same day by lower-index engineers. This matches the statement's rule that the one listed earlier in the file counts for the later one.\n  - **Assumption:** a task ending on day `t` no longer counts on day `t`. This is my reading of \"already working\"; the statement doesn't settle that boundary case.\n- **Abandoning features.** If a pending task of a started feature can no longer finish before `L`, that feature is dropped.\n- **Choosing the result.** Five fixed priority formulas are simulated, then a fixed number of randomly perturbed orderings with a fixed seed. The best-scoring schedule is output. The iteration count depends only on input size, so the output is deterministic.\n\n**What it leaves out**\n- **No moving services or creating new binaries.** This avoids the locking rules that make an output invalid, but it gives up the potential gain from merging a feature's services into one binary.\n- **Each feature/binary pair is assigned at most once**, which satisfies the \"one engineer per feature per binary\" rule.\n- **Output format.** Only engineers who have tasks are written, in index order, so each `T` is at least 1 and the same-day ordering stays consistent.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint L,G,S,B,F,N;\nvector<int> Rb;               // services per binary\nvector<string> fname;\nvector<int> FD, FU;\nvector<vector<int>> fb;       // binaries per feature\n\nstruct Res { long long score; vector<vector<pair<int,int>>> tasks; };\n\nlong long simulate(const vector<int>& order, vector<vector<pair<int,int>>>* rec){\n    vector<priority_queue<int,vector<int>,greater<int>>> act(B);\n    vector<vector<int>> bucket(L+1);\n    bucket[0].resize(G);\n    for(int i=0;i<G;i++) bucket[0][i]=i;\n    vector<char> dead(F,0);\n    vector<int> rem(F,0), fe(F,0);\n    vector<char> opened(F,0);\n    deque<pair<int,int>> pending;\n    size_t ptr=0;\n    bool allDone=false;\n    if(rec){ rec->assign(G,{}); }\n    for(int t=0;t<L && !allDone;t++){\n        auto &bk=bucket[t];\n        sort(bk.begin(),bk.end());\n        for(int e:bk){\n            bool assigned=false;\n            while(!assigned){\n                if(!pending.empty()){\n                    auto [f,b]=pending.front(); pending.pop_front();\n                    if(dead[f]) continue;\n                    auto &h=act[b];\n                    while(!h.empty() && h.top()<=t) h.pop();\n                    int C=h.size();\n                    int dur=FD[f]+Rb[b]+C;\n                    if(t+dur>=L){ dead[f]=1; continue; }\n                    h.push(t+dur);\n                    fe[f]=max(fe[f],t+dur);\n                    rem[f]--;\n                    bucket[t+dur].push_back(e);\n                    if(rec) (*rec)[e].push_back({f,b});\n                    assigned=true;\n                } else if(ptr<order.size()){\n                    int f=order[ptr++];\n                    bool ok=true;\n                    for(int b:fb[f]){\n                        auto &h=act[b];\n                        while(!h.empty() && h.top()<=t) h.pop();\n                        int C=h.size();\n                        if(t+FD[f]+Rb[b]+C>=L){ok=false;break;}\n                    }\n                    if(!ok) continue;\n                    opened[f]=1;\n                    rem[f]=fb[f].size();\n                    for(int b:fb[f]) pending.push_back({f,b});\n                } else { allDone=true; break; }\n            }\n            if(allDone) break;\n        }\n        vector<int>().swap(bk);\n    }\n    long long sc=0;\n    for(int f=0;f<F;f++){\n        if(opened[f] && !dead[f] && rem[f]==0 && fe[f]<L) sc+=(long long)FU[f]*(L-fe[f]);\n    }\n    return sc;\n}\n\nint main(){\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);cin.tie(nullptr);\n    cin>>L>>G>>S>>B>>F>>N;\n    unordered_map<string,int> sid; sid.reserve(S*2);\n    vector<int> sb(S);\n    Rb.assign(B,0);\n    for(int i=0;i<S;i++){string s;int b;cin>>s>>b;sid[s]=i;sb[i]=b;Rb[b]++;}\n    fname.resize(F);FD.resize(F);FU.resize(F);fb.resize(F);\n    long long totalTasks=0;\n    for(int i=0;i<F;i++){\n        int M;cin>>fname[i]>>M>>FD[i]>>FU[i];\n        vector<int> bs;\n        for(int j=0;j<M;j++){string s;cin>>s;bs.push_back(sb[sid[s]]);}\n        sort(bs.begin(),bs.end());bs.erase(unique(bs.begin(),bs.end()),bs.end());\n        int D=FD[i];\n        sort(bs.begin(),bs.end(),[&](int a,int b){\n            if(Rb[a]!=Rb[b]) return Rb[a]>Rb[b]; return a<b;});\n        fb[i]=bs; totalTasks+=bs.size();\n        (void)D;\n    }\n    vector<double> sumc(F),maxc(F);\n    for(int f=0;f<F;f++){\n        double s=0,m=0;\n        for(int b:fb[f]){double c=FD[f]+Rb[b];s+=c;m=max(m,c);}\n        sumc[f]=s;maxc[f]=m;\n    }\n    auto makeOrder=[&](const vector<double>& key){\n        vector<int> o(F);iota(o.begin(),o.end(),0);\n        stable_sort(o.begin(),o.end(),[&](int a,int b){return key[a]>key[b];});\n        return o;\n    };\n    vector<vector<double>> keys;\n    for(int k=0;k<5;k++){\n        vector<double> key(F);\n        for(int f=0;f<F;f++){\n            double U=FU[f],sc=sumc[f],mc=maxc[f],nb=fb[f].size();\n            double rem=max(1.0,(double)L-mc);\n            switch(k){\n                case 0:key[f]=U/sc;break;\n                case 1:key[f]=U*rem/sc;break;\n                case 2:key[f]=U/(sc*mc);break;\n                case 3:key[f]=U*rem/nb;break;\n                case 4:key[f]=U*rem/(sc*sqrt(mc));break;\n            }\n        }\n        keys.push_back(key);\n    }\n    long long best=-1; vector<int> bestOrder; vector<double> bestKey;\n    for(auto&key:keys){\n        auto o=makeOrder(key);\n        long long s=simulate(o,nullptr);\n        if(s>best){best=s;bestOrder=o;bestKey=key;}\n    }\n    double work=(double)totalTasks+G+L+F;\n    int iters=(int)min(60.0,3e7/work);\n    mt19937 rng(12345);\n    normal_distribution<double> nd(0.0,1.0);\n    for(int it=0;it<iters;it++){\n        double sigma=0.3*(1.0-(double)it/max(1,iters))+0.02;\n        vector<double> key(F);\n        for(int f=0;f<F;f++) key[f]=bestKey[f]*exp(sigma*nd(rng));\n        auto o=makeOrder(key);\n        long long s=simulate(o,nullptr);\n        if(s>best){best=s;bestOrder=o;bestKey=key;}\n    }\n    vector<vector<pair<int,int>>> rec;\n    simulate(bestOrder,&rec);\n    string out;\n    int E=0;\n    for(int e=0;e<G;e++) if(!rec[e].empty()) E++;\n    out+=to_string(E)+\"\\n\";\n    for(int e=0;e<G;e++){\n        if(rec[e].empty()) continue;\n        out+=to_string(rec[e].size())+\"\\n\";\n        for(auto&[f,b]:rec[e]){\n            out+=\"impl \"+fname[f]+\" \"+to_string(b)+\"\\n\";\n        }\n    }\n    fwrite(out.data(),1,out.size(),stdout);\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
